ok   a key nested 10000 levels deep raises TooDeep instead of overflowing the stack
ok   TooDeep and TooMany are StandardErrors (assert_raises rescues only those)
ok   nesting exactly MAX_DEPTH deep parses, one more raises
ok   the deepest allowed key lands its value at the bottom
ok   a malformed bracket run is still one plain key
ok   a key with MAX_DEPTH pairs and a malformed tail is one plain key; one more pair is TooDeep
ok   a non-ASCII key with 100000 bracket pairs is refused as TooDeep
ok   Query.decode (shared by Query and Cookies) decodes clean escapes
ok   MAX_PAIRS pairs parse, one more raises TooMany
ok   empty pairs do not count towards the limit
ok   20000 key kind flips complete and keep the last write
ok   flips within one parse keep Rack's last-write-wins
ok   set_path and merge! handle a 5000 level chain iteratively
ok   Malformed (an undecodable percent-escape under CRuby) is a client fault: 400, not 500
14 tests, 40 assertions, 0 failures
